IMHO Frost Brand still beats Stormbringer for wizards.

Perhaps it is a bit esoteric, but next to anybody can make sure
Stormbringer is the first gift they get. If you are a chaotic elf, you
can #name Sting and Orcrist. Then only Stormbringer remains eligible
as a first sacrifice gift because the other artifacts either aren't
chaotic or hate your current form. It is enough to polymorph into an
elf, and to become chaotic from the helm of opposite alignment, if you
can be bothered. If your class gets a guaranteed first gift
(Magicbane, Cleaver, Mjollnir, ...), it will be the first sacrifice
gift after taking the helm off.


